---
description: Tests and quality rules
globs:
  - "tests/**/*.php"
  - "src/Resources/assets/tests/**/*.ts"
  - "phpunit.xml*"
  - "vitest.config.*"
alwaysApply: false
---

When changing behavior, prefer adding or updating the nearest relevant test.

Prefer:
- one focused test
- minimal fixture changes
- preserving the existing testing style
- test updates close to the changed behavior

Do not introduce new testing frameworks unless explicitly requested.
Do not rewrite unrelated tests.

Commands (Docker, from the repository root):
- `make test` — PHPUnit; `make test-coverage` — PHPUnit with coverage (`coverage-php.txt`)
- `make test-ts` — Vitest with coverage (`coverage-ts.txt`, HTML in `coverage-ts/`)
- `make qa` — PHP-CS-Fixer check, PHPStan, PHPUnit and Vitest; `make rector-dry` — Rector dry run
- `make release-check` — full pre-release gate (assets, QA, coverage, Vitest, translations, demos)
- `make -C demo/symfony8 test-e2e` — Playwright end-to-end tests against the demo
